Transform business needs into practical applications and innovative AI/LLM-powered solutions;
Design, fine-tune, deploy, and enhance AI/ML models tailored to real-world business challenges;
Experiment with prompt engineering, model parameters, and emerging LLM capabilities to improve solution quality;
Build R&D proof-of-concepts using tools such as Jupyter and work with complex datasets to validate new ideas;
Develop secure, scalable, cloud-native AI solutions while promoting responsible AI practices, governance, and effective guardrails.


You Will Need


2+ years of hands-on experience in Machine Learning, Generative AI, or Data Science, with strong Python skills and a solid software engineering background (C#/.NET or Java/Spring Boot);
