Knowledge of databases, scalable system architecture, and cloud environments such as AWS (including SageMaker and Bedrock) or equivalent Azure services;
Strong understanding of AI security, data privacy, API protection, trusted AI practices, and experience working within Agile/Scrum teams, with fluent English;
CPLP nationality or an EU work permit is required to facilitate employment.


